<description>&lt;p&gt;Grenade blasts hit Thailand's southern insurgency zone, wounding security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala, while a pipe bomb attack injured army officers in the same region. Cambodia continues to protest Thai military road construction in Oddar Meanchey and disputes over three border temples, with Thai officials rejecting the incursion claims. A Cambodian film about the 1979 refugee crisis has sparked controversy in Thailand, prompting officials to urge calm. The Thai government is introducing digital border passes to speed queues at the Mae Sai crossing and, together with Singapore and Malaysia, has joined the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative, and UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPZ1lnV1FkLU04eDRmdThnTU8ySXczQ0VyUmNnN2pieWtfN1A2RGFGeHR1Zi14c1M1OHFRZWxKQnBfXzNRZ0Y5RkRXbGJ6TUJDdXM3SmdtU2pEREJkNHI0U0U3NjlBU0dpLWRfSmMzOTFPRGxCelZueXdDcU5oNjVnUW4xUkMwOEdQMkZoQUxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vietnam.vn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE16SVJJNUNZRm1IZGhXR3RzUGxpQkdmM2E5SUd6a0JPVHpiTWFtZ3ZzT1BsNUdjS3ZzN3YyQXcxOThMX1czLWdqY0xUQ2FISXB4R0tRZGt6aU1EVllGVG5qeWc4UEJyZGY1MUdLWFBSaHJZZ3MzZWFYaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;IOL&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQeU9NVDNPck5CdTJMY3VkeHRpeHNGbnZYOTU4VlBlalZGS2RkN1JEN0FFV2l2WjNibkxZN1J6c0RwRkdXWldOT3BJRU5JVjNLTU1FUGtveTJad0NxT3dUSmRPSV8tWUJCXzE3RXBWek5IT2RCVFRyVHRzUk9mTUxjTjBfZ3A5Y08yY3VXd2FsWXhDYXV0Vmd6SjNOcE5mMjlPb0Z4T0EyR0h1ejd2LVp2UDNCb2J3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9tMTlVNzlmOEI2RlRxMFhjbWlnM3ItSmZpbTNfNEdid2tNQ0NvczQzSzJRQjgzLXdBZ